  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2305.15 Retainage",
  "priorExpiration": "2024-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2305.15 Retainage.\n\n(a) The recipient may withhold a percentage of all partial payments to contractors on a project as retainage until the project is complete.\n\n(b) If the recipient intends to withhold a retainage, the recipient shall specify the terms and conditions relating to the retainage in the contract documents submitted pursuant to Env-Wq 2307.01.\n\nSource. #13858, INTERIM, eff 1-27-24, EXPIRED: 7-25-24\n\nNew. #14078, eff 9-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2300.html"
}
